{{also|Vivi}}
==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
Latin, Italian [[vivere]]; Spanish [[vivir]]; Portuguese [[viver]]; French [[vivre]]

===Verb===
{{eo-head}}

# to [[live]]
#: ''La ribelantoj preferas morti kiel liberuloj ol '''vivi''' kiel sklavoj.''
#:: The revolters prefer to die as free men than to live as slaves.

====Conjugation====
{{eo-conj|viv|intr=yes}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|eo|ĝisvivi|gloss=to survive until, to "live to see"}}
* {{l|eo|reviviĝi|gloss=to return to life}}
* {{l|eo|travivi|gloss=to [[live through]]}}
* {{l|eo|viva|gloss=alive}}
* {{l|eo|vivaĵo|gloss=a [[living thing]]}}
* {{l|eo|vive|gloss=in a lively manner}}
* {{l|eo|vivo|gloss=life}}
* {{l|eo|vivukrio}}

